      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——看着创世驹脸上的笑容，心想，\n果然还是不能让她露出那样悲怆的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03bb65208b97b2c687525557742f9e609d2edae41350b110dc7c9e8bb88e022b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
